~ start

Thomas: Atlas, home sweet Cicely.
Thomas: The town that sleeps and whispers with the woods.
Thomas: It was long forgotten at the back of my head...
Thomas: But... why did the phone tell me to return back here?
Thomas: My "destiny"? What could they mean?
Thomas: Could it be from someone I know?
Thomas: I need to keep searching...

=> END

~ visitor_center_locked

Thomas: The doors are locked.
Thomas: I guess the town doesn't welcome new visitors anymore.
Thomas: And maybe also the returning ones...

=> END

~ visitor_center_map_info

Welcome Board: Welcome to Cicely, South Dakota!
Welcome Board: A quiet town surrounded by open landscapes, peaceful neighborhoods, and a close-knit community.
Welcome Board: Whether you're visiting or just passing through,
Welcome Board: we hope you enjoy your stay and feel at home in Cicely.

=> END

~ visitor_center_map_interact

Thomas: There are multiple brochures that contain the town map information.
Thomas: It's been more than a decade since I moved out, a lot of things have changed.
Thomas: This town map will come in handy.

=> END

~ visitor_center_barrier

if has_item("map")
	=> visitor_center_barrier_map
else
	=> visitor_center_barrier_nomap

~ visitor_center_barrier_nomap

if has_item("map")
	=> visitor_center_barrier_map

Thomas: There is a big tree blocking the road. I cannot drive in any further.
Thomas: I would have to climb over the log and continue moving on foot.
Thomas: It might be a good idea to find something that can help me navigate easier.

=> END

~ visitor_center_barrier_map

Thomas: There is a big tree blocking the road. I cannot drive in any further.
Thomas: I would have to climb over the log and continue moving on foot.
Thomas: Should I proceed?
- Yes
	do proceed()
	=> END
- No
	=> END

~ visitor_center_barrier_post_teleport

Thomas: I have driven this far, and I cannot go back now.
Thomas: There could be someone down the road.

=> END

~ after_climb_over

=> visitor_center_barrier_post_teleport

~ post_teleport

=> visitor_center_barrier_post_teleport
